---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';import DocCards from '../components/DocCards.astro';import {url,sectionDocs} from '../lib/content';
const paths=[{number:'01',title:'从业务后端调用智能体',label:'开放API',text:'一次性JSON、SSE流式输出，或创建异步长任务。Key固定员工、执行引擎和业务范围。',link:'open-api',code:'POST /api/openai/v1/chat/completions\nPOST /api/open/v1/runs'},{number:'02',title:'让业务系统认识当前员工',label:'统一身份',text:'网页使用OIDC完成身份登录；业务网关逐请求核验短期Token，再按自身账号和权限处理。',link:'identity',code:'OIDC + PKCE S256\nPOST /identity/introspect'},{number:'03',title:'交付做法、工具和业务页面',label:'Skill · MCP · 面板',text:'用Skill保存做事方法，用MCP提供远程工具，用静态面板组织页面操作。',link:'skills',code:'SKILL.md / scripts / references\nwindow.hivePanel.getSystemContext(...)'}];
---
<SiteLayout title="开发与对接 · 蜂巢" description="开放API、异步任务、统一身份、Skill、MCP和业务面板开发指南。"><section class="page-intro container"><span class="eyebrow">FOR DEVELOPERS / 选择你的接入点</span><h1>已有系统，<br/><em>不必推倒重来。</em></h1><div class="page-intro-bottom"><p>从智能体调用、员工身份或企业能力交付中选择起点。<br/>理解接口契约，也理解谁负责业务权限与执行结果。</p><a class="button primary" href={url('/docs/developers/overview/')}>接入快速开始<Icon name="arrow" size={18}/></a></div></section><section class="container developer-paths">{paths.map(path=><article><div><span class="eyebrow">{path.number} / {path.label}</span><h2>{path.title}</h2><p>{path.text}</p><a class="inline-link" href={url('/docs/developers/'+path.link+'/')}>阅读对接指南<Icon name="arrow" size={18}/></a></div><pre><code>{path.code}</code></pre></article>)}</section><section class="section principles"><div class="container developer-note"><Icon name="shield" size={36}/><div><h2>把身份带过去，<br/>把业务权限留在业务系统。</h2><p>系统资格、资源分配和业务权限分别检查。开放API Key留在服务端；短期业务身份不写入对话、日志或持久文件。网站上的示例地址和参数只用于说明协议。</p></div><a class="inline-link" href={url('/docs/developers/identity/')}>阅读身份与授权指南<Icon name="arrow" size={18}/></a></div></section><section class="section container"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">REFERENCE & GUIDES</span><h2>从接口到实现，<br/>按主题查阅。</h2></div><p>示例说明前提、结果与错误处理，<br/>不依赖内部联调环境。</p></div><DocCards docs={sectionDocs('developers')}/></section></SiteLayout>
